    {
      "id": "claim_c53c20fecbac498485ea93e57306fddd",
      "statement": "Work package creation flows from WorkPackageTools.workPackageCreate through Bean Validation (@Validated with OnCreate + Default groups), into OpenProjectApiClient.workPackageCreate which builds a PatchMap model and renders create_work_package.ftl to produce a JSON payload, then POSTs to /api/v3/projects/{projectId}/work_packages and returns the created work package ID.",
