      "statement": "The update_work_package.ftl template renders a partial JSON payload that always includes lockVersion, conditionally includes _links.type and _links.priority, conditionally includes mutable fields (subject, description, startDate, dueDate, estimatedTime, storyPoints), and sets _meta.validateCustomFields to true.",
