      "statement": "create_work_package.ftl always sets scheduleManually to true, hardcodes status to /api/v3/statuses/1, and explicitly sets duration to null, while conditionally emitting startDate, dueDate, estimatedTime, storyPoints, and priority _links only when their values are present.",
